  "name": "LXG - 06 - Health Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LXG-06 Health Monitor (heartbeat)\nHourly. Asks the n8n API for every `LXG - *` workflow's last success / last failure, writes the **Heartbeat** tab and emails an alert when a workflow is inactive, failing, stale or missing (max one alert per issue per 24h).\n\nNeeds an n8n API key (Settings → n8n API) saved as credential *LXG n8n API*. Optional: `HEARTBEAT_PING_URL` for an external dead-man's-switch.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "97ea2156-89db-5666-84c6-5d39b4cd8060",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -440
      ]
    },
